Autonomous RFQ Processing and Supplier Onboarding System (GCP)

Overview

This project implements a serverless procurement automation pipeline on Google Cloud Platform. It processes inbound supplier quotations (RFQs), evaluates risk, stores structured data, and enables automated outbound communication using SendGrid.

The system is designed to be scalable, modular, and extensible, with planned support for Document AI-based extraction of supplier onboarding documents such as W-9 forms.



